[19.868995, "i", "ining us today.</p>\\n    <p><strong>This is your first-day welcome note from {manager_name}</strong>, not a routine system notification.</p>\\n    <p>Please take a minute to read this before you dive into setup:</p>\\n    <ol>\\n      <li>Reply to this email if you need help or cannot access a tool. Your reply will go directly to <a href=\"mailto:{manager_email}\">{manager_name}</a>.</li>\\n      <li>Look for your calendar invite or first-day chat from {manager_name}.</li>\\n      <li>Keep this message handy for your first-day onboarding steps and questions.</li>\\n    </ol>\\n    <p>We are glad you are here and want your first day to feel clear, welcoming, and supported.</p>\\n    <p>- People Team</p>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\\n\"\"\"\\n\\n    msg.set_content(plain)\\n    msg.add_alternative(html, subtype=\"html\")\\n\\n    with smtplib.SMTP(host, port) as server:\\n        server.send_message(msg)\\n    print(\"Welcome email sent.\")\\n    return 0\\n'''\nif old not in text:\n    raise SystemExit('expected send_welcome stub not found')\npath"]
